WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:03.000
- LA definitely steps
it up with the fashion.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:05.440
- LA cool, but Tampa is where it's at.

00:00:05.440 --> 00:00:06.700
We bosses around here.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.283
(upbeat music)

00:00:10.210 --> 00:00:12.290
- To me, LA is the best
city on the planet.

00:00:12.290 --> 00:00:13.800
- Tampa is everything.

00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:14.633
It's amazing.

00:00:14.633 --> 00:00:16.850
- I don't want to be mean
about Tampa, but come on.

00:00:16.850 --> 00:00:18.980
- Tampa is the best city in the world.

00:00:18.980 --> 00:00:20.170
I love my city.

00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:23.300
- LA real estate is more
expensive, but more amazing.

00:00:23.300 --> 00:00:26.420
- There's more family
oriented things here in Tampa.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:28.330
- LA is better than Tampa because-

00:00:28.330 --> 00:00:31.280
- Where else can you rub
elbows with Hollywood's elite?

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:34.160
- You should move to Tampa
versus LA because of the traffic.

00:00:34.160 --> 00:00:36.719
When you go to the beach,
the water is actually warm.

00:00:36.719 --> 00:00:39.810
- LA, it's like the perfect
mix between New York and Miami.

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:40.840
There's the nightlife,

00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:43.190
also nice restaurants and nice people.

00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:46.980
- LA is the very best city out
there because of the weather,

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:50.560
the ocean, the mountains,
the glam, entertainment,

00:00:50.560 --> 00:00:52.200
and of course, the real estate.

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:54.840
- We have the laid back beach lifestyle.

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.550
We have professional
sports teams that win.

00:00:57.550 --> 00:00:58.383
- And by the way,

00:00:58.383 --> 00:00:59.740
I think the Superbowl's
coming over here too,

00:00:59.740 --> 00:01:01.490
so good luck, Tampa.

00:01:01.490 --> 00:01:04.730
- Tampa is a very welcoming
city, very family friendly.

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:07.590
- I lived in Florida and the
weather there is extremely hot.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.570
- LA people are cocky, beautiful.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.010
- I think that Tampa
people are more laid back.

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:13.843
- In Los Angeles,

00:01:13.843 --> 00:01:16.430
we have unbelievably exciting
architecture and real estate.

00:01:16.430 --> 00:01:18.210
I mean, I don't think there's a
better city in the world

00:01:18.210 --> 00:01:19.130
for real estate.

00:01:19.130 --> 00:01:21.370
- LA is the center of everything.

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.580
- Can I say that LA is pretentious?

00:01:23.580 --> 00:01:25.150
- I can't diss LA.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:27.930
LA does have the style,
but we've got it too.

00:01:27.930 --> 00:01:30.730
We don't have to do too much
because we in warm weather,

00:01:30.730 --> 00:01:33.500
so we can throw on a two
piece and call it a day.

00:01:33.500 --> 00:01:36.270
- Our real estate in LA is way better.

00:01:36.270 --> 00:01:38.880
- You should come to
Tampa, as opposed to LA,

00:01:38.880 --> 00:01:41.960
because you can enjoy summer year round.

00:01:41.960 --> 00:01:43.660
- I'm sure there are
people that live there,

00:01:43.660 --> 00:01:45.110
but I don't think I've ever been.

00:01:45.110 --> 00:01:47.530
- People from LA wanna be in Tampa,

00:01:47.530 --> 00:01:50.493
because they're buying
the houses. (laughs)

